sequenceDiagram
  participant AD as Administrator
  participant AG as Agent
  participant K as Keywarden API
  participant N as Nginx

  AD->>K: Create one-time enrollment token
  AG->>AG: Generate keypair + CSR
  AG->>K: POST /agent/enroll (token + CSR + host/IP)
  K->>K: Validate token, create/update Server, sign client cert
  K-->>AG: server_id + client_cert + ca_cert (+ token metadata)
  AG->>AG: Persist cert/key/ca and server_id

  loop Runtime polling
    AG->>N: /api/v1/agent/* with client cert
    N->>K: Forward request + TLS client headers
    K->>K: Validate mTLS cert fingerprint/serial against server
    K-->>AG: 200 + policy/state payload
  end

  alt mTLS context missing and fallback enabled
    AG->>K: Authorization: Bearer <agent token>
    K->>K: Validate server/global token
    K-->>AG: 200 (compatibility mode)
  else mTLS strict mode
    K-->>AG: 401 Unauthorized
  end
